  "description": "The new XC Gravel is our premier offering developed specifically for gravel racing. It is engineered to deliver speed and efficiency across any combination of asphalt, gravel, and unpaved roads.\n\nThe frame is constructed using the \"tube-to-tube\" (wrapped) technique, utilizing a curated blend of ultra-high modulus carbon fibers (T800, T1000, and M46J). This layup is precisely calibrated to achieve the optimal balance between three core attributes:\n\nRigidity & Responsiveness: Maximizes power transfer for immediate acceleration.\n\nControl & Durability: Ensures precise handling and confidence in all riding conditions.\n\nComfort & Compliance: Dampens high-frequency vibrations to reduce fatigue over long distances.\n\nEvery detail and standard on the XC Gravel has been selected to combine modern performance with mechanical efficiency and ease of maintenance:\n\nFully Integrated Cable Routing: Clean aesthetics and improved aerodynamics.\n\nUDH Gear Hanger: Equipped with the Universal Derailleur Hanger standard for worldwide compatibility and easy replacement.\n\nT47 Threaded Bottom Bracket: Combines the stiffness of modern oversized shells with the reliability and quietness of a threaded system.\n\nTraditional Seatpost Clamp: A classic external clamp chosen for maximum reliability, simplicity, and ease of adjustment.\n\nDrivetrain Versatility: Fully compatible with both 1x and 2x drivetrains.\n\nTire Clearance: Generous clearance to accommodate tires up to 50 mm wide.",
